CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --enforce-contract release --enforce-contract acquire
^\[free\.frees\.\d+\] line \d+ Check that ptr is freeable: FAILURE$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
--
With an empty frees clause, the call to free is still checked against the
write set of release.
